BlueShare reuses InputShare's approach (edge switching between the PC and an Android
device, HID keyboard/mouse report descriptors) and replaces its ADB/scrcpy transport
with a Bluetooth HID-over-GATT peripheral published by Windows, so no USB debugging
is required on the tablet. All code in this repository was rewritten for that design.
